<title>SOUTH KOREA: Sunkyong Industry '96 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Sunkyong Industry '96 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)	     (loss) 4,633     vs (gain) 1,299</p>
<p>    Net		     (loss)    54.1   vs (gain) 13.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax net	   (loss)    53.8   vs (gain) 16.4</p>
<p>    Turnover			   672.5   vs	 857.4</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, in cash, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>			 common	   none   vs    10.0</p>
<p>			 preferred	none   vs    11.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinary loss		52.1   vs    none</p>
<p>Note - Sunkyong Industry Co Ltd said its 1996 share capital was 8.99 million common shares and 2.69 million preferred shares, unchanged from a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
